tate.json" "file_sha256" "f8dde3b02dae44d30dfb9f925f4e8b66b746f9ec011754fa1b21266d4b9288e3"} {"question" "q-331230" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate $f(t)=7u(t-1)$ at $t=-4,$ where $u$ is the unit step function.\n\n$f(t)=$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14037461/state.json" "file_sha256" "f8dde3b02dae44d30dfb9f925f4e8b66b746f9ec011754fa1b21266d4b9288e3"} {"question" "q-331230" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The unit step function $u(t)$ is defined as\n\n$$\nu(t)={\\begin{aligned}1,\\,t\\ge 0, \\\\ 0,\\,t<0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluating $f(t)$ at $t=-4,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(-4) & =7u(-4-1) \\\\  & =7u(-5) \\\\  & =7\\cdot 0 \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $f(-4)=0.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14037461/state.json" "file_sha256" "f8dde3b02dae44d30dfb9f925f4e8b66b746f9ec011754fa1b21266d4b9288e3"} {"question" "q-331230" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14037461/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "917e7f34b46182f09dcb2df1b7ef2a85593c8d08684973866d7c2ebca0fa9584"} {"question" "q-331230" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14037461/state.json" "file_sha256" "f8dde3b02dae44d30dfb9f925f4e8b66b746f9ec011754fa1b21266d4b9288e3"} {"question" "q-331230" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "0"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-